[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 9241.27, "timestamp": "02:34:01", "text": "處理這做那的事情，對吧"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9242.95, "timestamp": "02:34:02", "text": "？但我當時想，不，我沒錢。所以我不得不坐下來。就算我這笨腦袋也"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9266.63, "timestamp": "02:34:26", "text": "能應付大部分事情，但"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 9268.908, "timestamp": "02:34:28", "author": "@Surya_VT", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/xYZGMsDSkF4w1IOdT2xKmMHI-M3-NParGStQvKERjxxwivecaInz95y5n8jliQSZ7SgMMYzdrw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "UCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/-fgfY9DIGYjbhgHLzoDIDwUCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/-fgfY9DIGYjbhgHLzoDIDwUCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/-fgfY9DIGYjbhgHLzoDIDwUCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/-fgfY9DIGYjbhgHLzoDIDw"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9274.23, "timestamp": "02:34:34", "text": "我還是會腦超負荷。所以我得坐下來，慢慢來，穩紮穩打，理解它，一步一步來，理解並學習如何使用軟體，然後再去做。所以，這就是我的故事，為什麼我在做 Sammy 這樣的項目，以及我為此投入了多少精力。我"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 9283.598, "timestamp": "02:34:43", "author": "@Surya_VT", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/xYZGMsDSkF4w1IOdT2xKmMHI-M3-NParGStQvKERjxxwivecaInz95y5n8jliQSZ7SgMMYzdrw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "i joined too late to be part of that"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9290.07, "timestamp": "02:34:50", "text": "討厭那種卡住的時候，就像現在這樣，我的大腦無法繼續運作。然後我休息一會兒，喘口氣，再回過頭來"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9299.83, "timestamp": "02:34:59", "text": "思考，就會想，哦，"}]